      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f30a4580d85f347c361e55d|full_name}: You can curl the fingers smoothly in Skeletal data input mode.\n\nWe tested the behaviour of Legacy Fingers vs the previous build on live and could not find any major differences matching your description, _if_ bindings had been reset correctly.\n\nNote that for some users, a full reset required deleting their bindings JSON files entirely, see: https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/vive-unique-movement-control-is-gone-resolved",
