  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "After the recent update Valve index Finger tracking has become less sensitive and a lot less reliable, mainly the Middle and pinky Fingers tracking have less sensitivity than the Ring and Index Fingers, this affect All Valve index controller users. this issue is not resolved using the \"Legacy Finger Tracking\" option, in addition the Legacy finger tracking animation for a full Fist is not complete and does not close the fingers to make a fist.",
